  {
    "insert": "\nAs a transition between the state of the art and the methodology, a theoretical framework is important to motivate your specific method. In your case, that would probably either be explaining some models/concepts a bit more in detail, or to explain your idea of a model more in depth as \"GenAI model\" is still quite general. You could e.g. motivate an idea/draft of an architecture, based on existing models or - if you are unsure - explain advantages and disadvantages of different models for this application."
